{"id":"torrey:sea-the","source":"torrey","name":"Sea, The","slug":"sea-the","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"The gathering together of the waters originally called — Ge 1:10.","refs":[["Gen",1,10,1,10]]},{"text":"Great rivers often called — Isa 11:15; Jer 51:36.","refs":[["Isa",11,15,11,15],["Jer",51,36,51,36]]},{"text":"Lakes often called — De 3:17; Mt 8:24,27,32.","refs":[["Deut",3,17,3,17],["Matt",8,24,8,24],["Matt",8,27,8,27],["Matt",8,32,8,32]]},{"text":"Created. — Ex 20:11; Ps 95:5; Ac 14:15.","refs":[["Exod",20,11,20,11],["Ps",95,5,95,5],["Acts",14,15,14,15]]},{"text":"Made the birds and fished out of. — Ge 1:20-22.","refs":[["Gen",1,20,1,22]]},{"text":"Founded the earth upon. — Ps 24:2.","refs":[["Ps",24,2,24,2]]},{"text":"Set bounds to, by a perpetual decree. — Job 26:10; 38:8,10,11; Pr 8:27,29.","refs":[["Job",26,10,26,10],["Job",38,8,38,8],["Job",38,10,38,10],["Job",38,11,38,11],["Prov",8,27,8,27],["Prov",8,29,8,29]]},{"text":"Measures the waters of. — Isa 40:12.","refs":[["Isa",40,12,40,12]]},{"text":"Does what he pleases in. — Ps 135:6.","refs":[["Ps",135,6,135,6]]},{"text":"Dries up, by his rebuke. — Isa 50:2; Na 1:4.","refs":[["Isa",50,2,50,2],["Nah",1,4,1,4]]},{"text":"Shakes, by his word. — Hag 2:6.","refs":[["Hag",2,6,2,6]]},{"text":"Stills, by his power. — Ps 65:7; 89:9; 107:29.","refs":[["Ps",65,7,65,7],["Ps",89,9,89,9],["Ps",107,29,107,29]]},{"text":"Of immense extent — Job 11:9; Ps 104:25.","refs":[["Job",11,9,11,9],["Ps",104,25,104,25]]},{"text":"Of great depth — Ps 68:22.","refs":[["Ps",68,22,68,22]]},{"text":"Rivers supplied by exhalations from — Ec 1:7.","refs":[["Eccl",1,7,1,7]]},{"text":"Replenished by rivers — Ec 1:7; Eze 47:8.","refs":[["Eccl",1,7,1,7],["Ezek",47,8,47,8]]},{"text":"Deep. — Job 41:31; Ps 107:24; 2Co 11:25.","refs":[["Job",41,31,41,31],["Ps",107,24,107,24],["2Cor",11,25,11,25]]},{"text":"Great waters. — Ps 77:19.","refs":[["Ps",77,19,77,19]]},{"text":"Great and wide sea. — Ps 104:25.","refs":[["Ps",104,25,104,25]]},{"text":"The clouds the garment of — Job 38:9.","refs":[["Job",38,9,38,9]]},{"text":"Darkness the swaddling band of — Job 38:9.","refs":[["Job",38,9,38,9]]},{"text":"Sand the barrier of — Jer 5:22.","refs":[["Jer",5,22,5,22]]},{"text":"Inhabited by innumerable creatures great and small — Ps 104:25,26.","refs":[["Ps",104,25,104,25],["Ps",104,26,104,26]]},{"text":"The wonders of God seen in — Ps 107:24.","refs":[["Ps",107,24,107,24]]},{"text":"Made to glorify God — Ps 69:34; 148:7.","refs":[["Ps",69,34,69,34],["Ps",148,7,148,7]]},{"text":"The Adriatic or sea of Adria. — Ac 27:27.","refs":[["Acts",27,27,27,27]]},{"text":"Mediterranean or great sea. — Nu 34:6; De 11:24; 34:2; Zec 14:8.","refs":[["Num",34,6,34,6],["Deut",11,24,11,24],["Deut",34,2,34,2],["Zech",14,8,14,8]]},{"text":"Red Sea. — Ex 10:19; 13:18; 23:31.","refs":[["Exod",10,19,10,19],["Exod",13,18,13,18],["Exod",23,31,23,31]]},{"text":"Sea of Joppa or sea of the Philistines. — Ezr 3:7; Ex 23:21.","refs":[["Ezra",3,7,3,7],["Exod",23,21,23,21]]},{"text":"Salt of Dead Sea. — Ge 14:3; Nu 34:12.","refs":[["Gen",14,3,14,3],["Num",34,12,34,12]]},{"text":"Sea of Galilee. — Mt 4:18; 8:32; Joh 6:1.","refs":[["Matt",4,18,4,18],["Matt",8,32,8,32],["John",6,1,6,1]]},{"text":"Sea of Jazer. — Jer 48:32.","refs":[["Jer",48,32,48,32]]},{"text":"Raised by the wind — Ps 107:25,26; Jon 1:4.","refs":[["Ps",107,25,107,25],["Ps",107,26,107,26],["Jonah",1,4,1,4]]},{"text":"Caused to foam by Leviathan — Job 41:31,32.","refs":[["Job",41,31,41,31],["Job",41,32,41,32]]},{"text":"Raised upon high. — Ps 93:3; 107:25.","refs":[["Ps",93,3,93,3],["Ps",107,25,107,25]]},{"text":"Tossed to and fro. — Jer 5:22.","refs":[["Jer",5,22,5,22]]},{"text":"Multitudinous. — Jer 51:42.","refs":[["Jer",51,42,51,42]]},{"text":"Mighty. — Ps 93:4; Ac 27:41.","refs":[["Ps",93,4,93,4],["Acts",27,41,27,41]]},{"text":"Tumultuous. — Lu 21:25; Jude 1:13.","refs":[["Luke",21,25,21,25],["Jude",1,13,1,13]]},{"text":"The shore of, covered with sand — Ge 22:17; 1Ki 4:29; Job 